    "B35 is unchanged-production characterization. A benchmark crash before any outcome or stop record remains untested.",
    "B36 covers cooperative Docker run and Compose up creation without conflicting caller options. Other creation variants, existing containers, direct APIs, forged metadata, and concurrent creation remain outside these tests.",
    "The model has atomic transitions and assumes successful creation. It does not establish implementation atomicity, every process race, or an aggregate wall-clock response bound.",
    "Healthy memory samples and preference values do not prove runner survival during memory exhaustion.",
    "Fixture cleanup is not production shutdown evidence. Archive retrieval is not proof of power-loss durability, successful fsync, storage-full handling, or remote upload durability.",
    "D2, D3 all-writer growth and reserve bounds, hosted execution, enforcement, maintainer review, claim ratification, and soak acceptance remain pending."
